VALUES (31225, 'tt0100332', NULL, 'Paris Is Burning', 'Paris Is Burning', 'movie', 1991, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/90rCWH41mj9hjHUEy2SOHfuAOl3.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1DOLRxIQbRxhZcllLVx4DUAGqfS.jpg', 'Where does voguing come from, and what, exactly, is throwing shade? This landmark documentary provides a vibrant snapshot of the 1980s through the eyes of New York City''s African American and Latinx Harlem drag-ball scene. Made over seven years, PARIS IS BURNING offers an intimate portrait of rival fashion "houses," from fierce contests for trophies to house mothers offering sustenance in a world rampant with homophobia, transphobia, racism, AIDS, and poverty. Featuring legendary voguers, drag queens, and trans women — including Willi Ninja, Pepper LaBeija, Dorian Corey, and Venus Xtravaganza.', NULL, NULL, 1.9572, 8.0, 0, 2.08442105263157912e+01, '2026-07-21 03:32:24', '2026-11-17 02:21:28')
