VALUES (16166, 'tt1124394', NULL, 'Sauna', 'Sauna', 'movie', 2008, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9OnBhOx8kAyA3BLi8bx83L2dQbA.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yNwoVVgx3avrfwJSgyBtXd7oSGM.jpg', 'It is 1595. Brutal wars have just ended in an uneasy peace between Protestant Sweden and Orthodox Russia. We focus on the spiritual defeats of two conquered Finnish brothers, one a hardened near-psychopathic war hero, the other a gentle scientist in an age with no use for such men. They find themselves in the swampy interior, demarcating the new border with a unit of sadistic Russians.', NULL, NULL, 1.006, 6.16, 0, 6.265, '2026-08-03 14:31:56', '2026-11-17 02:21:28')
