VALUES (11932, 'tt0144120', NULL, 'Bride of Chucky', 'Bride of Chucky', 'movie', 1998, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yaIPNOcC7ZRuwH3maNwP9qzIo5G.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fLTd0VxpijUt6Hm1QM2ehLpWPeu.jpg', 'For ten years, the tortured soul of serial killer Charles Lee Ray has been imprisoned inside a child''s doll. ''Chucky'' is reborn when his old flame, Tiffany, rescues his battered doll parts from a police impound. But Chucky wants his new playmate cut down to size, so he transforms his blushing bride into a stunning little terror. Chucky and Tiffany can''t wait to start their own homicidal honeymoon. When this demonic duo hits the road and hooks up with a pair of unsuspecting newlyweds, they leave a trail of murder and mayhem behind them. Chucky''s back!', NULL, NULL, 15.6385, 6.1, 0, 4.025, '2026-08-04 03:20:13', '2026-11-17 02:21:28')
